          our spread  implied true    share  corr w/ actual
  F3            0.32          0.39      83%           0.160
  F5            0.47          0.79      60%           0.205
  F7            0.56          0.69      81%           0.166

  'our spread' is the sd of our per-game predicted means.
  'implied true' is sqrt(var(actual) - mean within-game var):
  how much game-to-game variation really exists.
  share < 100% means we under-differentiate games.
